  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"加载器\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available-1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.1 | 1.21-ecebe6?labelColor=B446C6&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"支持版本\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1104430139275743293.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://iron431.github.io/Irons-Spellbooks-Docs/img/spellbooks-title-small-background.png\" alt=\"标志\"></p>\n<p>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks 将经典的RPG施法奇幻体验引入游戏。与危险的法师战斗，掠夺众多建筑，深入地下城探险，收集资源与法术，并寻找强大的魔法神器！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>特色内容：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>超过 100 种可升级的法术</li>\n<li>2 位施法 Boss</li>\n<li>9 位施法敌人/盟友/商人</li>\n<li>12 套法师护甲套装</li>\n<li>11 种随机生成的建筑</li>\n<li>武器附魔与护甲升级系统</li>\n<li>丰富的配置选项（包含单法术设置）</li>\n<li>原生兼容 JEI、JEED、Apotheosis、Tetra、Better Combat、Patchouli 等模组！</li>\n<li>以及更多内容！</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>常见问题：</h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>问：如何开始游玩《Spells 'n Spellbooks》？</strong></span> <br>\n答：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.iron.wiki%252fprogression%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.iron.wiki/progression/</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>问：是否会移植到 1.20.1（或其他版本/加载器）？</strong></span> <br>\n答：简短回答：不会。这些模组是个人兴趣项目，为单个版本开发需要投入<em>数月</em>的个人精力。不过，它们是开源的，并欢迎社区贡献：<a href=\"https://github.com/iron431/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/iron431/</a>。Patreon 上有抢先体验权限（<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/Iron431</a>）</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>问：我的模型损坏了/无法渲染</strong></span> <br>\n答：如果你安装了 Optifine，那就是它的问题。Optifine 仅适用于原版客户端。请使用许多与 Forge 兼容的替代方案（例如 Oculus）。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/echo_of_the_flamebearer.png\" alt=\"泰罗斯斯\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/inscription_table.png\" alt=\"铭文桌\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/scroll_forge.png\" alt=\"卷轴锻造台\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/structures.png\" alt=\"建筑结构\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/magic_loot.png\" alt=\"魔法战利品\">\n<img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/screenshots/ancient_city_loot.png\" alt=\"古城战利品\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>开发者信息：</h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firon.wiki%252fdevelopers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://iron.wiki/developers</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>支持我们：</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon支持\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://iron.wiki/img/ad/essential.jpg\" alt=\"Essential\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252firon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1b3bc821-298d-4efc-96d2-7dff77d7069a.png\" alt=\"Bisect\"></a></p>",
